~ cats_discourse
Cathline: Do you have cats ?
- Yes, and I love them deerly 
	Cathline: Awww, is that so ?
	=> cats_main
- No, I prefer dogs
	Cathline: Ewww, dogs !
	Cathline: I really despise them, what have they that cats don't ?
	- It's a matter of preferences
		Cathline: That I can understand ! [speed=1.5][font_size=10] For me you'll always be a freak tho !
	- Dogs are loyal
		Cathline: Cats are way more loyal. They just don't give their loyalty blindly !
	- Dogs don't hate you
		Cathline: Cats don't either ! You must just be a [shake rate=20 level=10] terrible person !
	- Dogs go out wandering with you
		Cathline: Cats also do that if you [shake rate=20 level=10] MAKE THEM WANNA GO WITH YOU. [/shake] 
		Cathline: No wonder they don't want to go out wandering with you if that's the kind of mentality you have !
	- I like dogs 
		Cathline: [shake rate=20 level=20] WELL YOU SHOULDN'T !
	Cathline: But... You know what !
	Cathline: I can understand [speed=1.5][font_size=10] (to some remote extent)
	Cathline: You can always return to the path of sanity by adopting a cat !
- No, I prefer being alone
	Cathline: Why so ?
	Cathline: Did your parents hit you when young ? Or do you just like to be sad and depressed ?
	Cathline: I get why people wouldn't want to go to the therapist (I really do) but to go so far as not owning a cat !
	Cathline: Wow, your childhood must've been REALLY sad !
	Cathline: My advice: adopt a cat !
=> END

